WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.487
Reading files is one of the places where Spark-specific syntax appears.

00:00:04.487 --> 00:00:09.517
CSV, Parquet, and Delta each have their own read patterns.

00:00:09.517 --> 00:00:17.742
After the data becomes a DataFrame or table, the relational SQL logic becomes more familiar.

00:00:17.742 --> 00:00:20.872
Do not confuse the file-ingestion step with the SQL analysis step.

00:00:20.872 --> 00:00:28.497
Spark distributes work across multiple processes and often multiple machines.

00:00:28.497 --> 00:00:32.817
The driver coordinates the job, while executors perform tasks on partitions of the data.

00:00:32.817 --> 00:00:41.662
This architecture becomes valuable when the data or workload is too large for one machine or when a platform

00:00:41.662 --> 00:00:44.480
needs scalable parallel processing.
